# N4 (LMX_semantics.ru.md #method-parts, #dynamic; next_core_tasks_v3.md N4): call: S D runs S over D. Each name of
# the code is the root field of the same name in D, at another position for every name: x is read from the last slot
# of D (41, not the 99 of the unit), y is written into its first (the re-run declaration, then y: x + 1 = 42). The
# pad of D between them keeps 9; the cells of S and the x of the unit are not touched. Entry 7.
int: x 99
S:
    int: x
    int: y 3
    y: x + 1
end: S
D:
    int: y 0
    int: pad 9
    int: x 41
end: D
int: sx S\x
fn: unit_x () int
    return: node\x
end: unit_x
call: S D
int: r 81
if: D\y = 42 && D\x = 41 && D\pad = 9 && S\y = 3 && S\x = sx && unit_x() = 99
    r: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: r; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
